flowchart LR
  eye[offline_eye: one repeated image at 120 Hz] --> image[Retained latest eye image]
  image --> worker[Independent eye_tracking worker on hart 0]
  worker --> int8[custom2 INT8 RITNet]
  int8 --> result[Retained latest completed eye prediction]
  result -->|Snapshot: new, reused, or unavailable| warp[Timewarp: upcoming vsync minus 2 ms]
  camera[offline_cam] --> vio[OpenVINS]
  imu[offline_imu] --> vio
  imu --> integrate[imu_integrator]
  vio --> integrate
  integrate --> prediction[Pose prediction service]
  render[Render: vsync plus 1 ms] --> prediction
  render --> frame[Retained latest completed frame]
  frame --> warp
  warp --> prediction
  warp --> gpu[Modeled asynchronous warp GPU work]
  gpu --> presentation[Main probe: modeled presentation at vsync]
  vio -. optional FP32 BLAS .-> fp32[Hart 0 worker: custom3 FP32 Gemmini]
